sequenceDiagram
    title RPG Maker MZ — Common events — Reserved, autorun and parallel

    actor User as Player
    participant SceneItem as Scene_Item / Scene_Skill
    participant GameAction as Game_Action
    participant GameTemp as $gameTemp
    participant SceneManager
    participant GameMap as $gameMap
    participant Interpreter as Game_Interpreter (map)
    participant CommonEvent as Game_CommonEvent
    participant CEInterpreter as Game_Interpreter (parallel)
    participant GameSwitches as $gameSwitches
    participant dataCommonEvents as $dataCommonEvents

    Note over SceneItem,GameTemp: 1. Reserved common event — item / skill effect "Common Event"
    User->>SceneItem: use item or skill from the menu
    SceneItem->>SceneItem: useItem()
    activate SceneItem
    SceneItem->>SceneItem: applyItem()
    activate SceneItem
    SceneItem->>GameAction: <<create>> new Game_Action(user)
    SceneItem->>GameAction: apply(target) for each target
    SceneItem->>GameAction: applyGlobal()
    activate GameAction
    loop each effect in item().effects
        opt effect.code === EFFECT_COMMON_EVENT
            GameAction->>GameTemp: reserveCommonEvent(effect.dataId)
            Note right of GameTemp: _commonEventQueue.push(id)
        end
    end
    deactivate GameAction
    deactivate SceneItem
    SceneItem->>SceneItem: checkCommonEvent()
    opt $gameTemp.isCommonEventReserved()
        SceneItem->>SceneManager: goto(Scene_Map)
        Note right of SceneManager: see scenemanager-scene-change.mmd
    end
    deactivate SceneItem
    Note over GameAction,GameTemp: In battle BattleManager.startAction() also calls applyGlobal(),<br/>and $gameTroop.setupBattleEvent() runs the queue with setupReservedCommonEvent()

    Note over GameMap,Interpreter: 2. Picked up on the map — Game_Map.updateInterpreter() when the interpreter is idle
    GameMap->>GameMap: setupStartingEvent()
    activate GameMap
    GameMap->>GameMap: refreshIfNeeded()
    GameMap->>Interpreter: setupReservedCommonEvent()
    activate Interpreter
    Interpreter->>GameTemp: isCommonEventReserved()
    alt queue not empty
        Interpreter->>GameTemp: retrieveCommonEvent()
        GameTemp->>dataCommonEvents: [_commonEventQueue.shift()]
        dataCommonEvents-->>Interpreter: commonEvent
        Interpreter->>Interpreter: setup(commonEvent.list)
        Note right of Interpreter: eventId = 0, runs like a normal event<br/>see game-interpreter-update.mmd
        Interpreter-->>GameMap: true → stop here
    else nothing reserved
        Interpreter-->>GameMap: false
        GameMap->>GameMap: setupTestEvent()
        GameMap->>GameMap: setupStartingMapEvent()
        Note right of GameMap: events with _starting = true (see game-interpreter-update.mmd)
        opt no map event started
            GameMap->>GameMap: setupAutorunCommonEvent()
            activate GameMap
            GameMap->>GameMap: autorunCommonEvents()
            GameMap->>dataCommonEvents: filter(trigger === 1)
            loop each autorun common event
                GameMap->>GameSwitches: value(commonEvent.switchId)
                opt switch is ON
                    GameMap->>Interpreter: setup(commonEvent.list)
                    Note right of Interpreter: the first matching one wins
                end
            end
            deactivate GameMap
            Note right of GameMap: when it ends, the next idle frame sets it up again,<br/>so an autorun keeps looping (and blocks the player)<br/>until its switch is turned OFF
        end
    end
    deactivate Interpreter
    deactivate GameMap

    Note over Interpreter,dataCommonEvents: Contrast — command117 (Common Event) does not use the queue
    Interpreter->>Interpreter: command117(params)
    Interpreter->>dataCommonEvents: [params[0]]
    Interpreter->>Interpreter: setupChild(commonEvent.list, eventId)
    Note right of Interpreter: runs inside a child Game_Interpreter (depth + 1)<br/>see game-interpreter-update.mmd

    Note over GameMap,CEInterpreter: 3. Parallel common events (trigger 2)
    GameMap->>GameMap: setupEvents() (on Game_Map.setup)
    activate GameMap
    GameMap->>GameMap: parallelCommonEvents()
    GameMap->>dataCommonEvents: filter(trigger === 2)
    loop each parallel common event
        GameMap->>CommonEvent: <<create>> new Game_CommonEvent(commonEvent.id)
        CommonEvent->>CommonEvent: refresh()
    end
    deactivate GameMap

    Note over GameSwitches,GameMap: a switch change → onChange() → $gameMap.requestRefresh()<br/>→ next refreshIfNeeded() → Game_Map.refresh() (see event-page-refresh.mmd)
    GameMap->>CommonEvent: refresh()
    activate CommonEvent
    CommonEvent->>CommonEvent: isActive()
    CommonEvent->>dataCommonEvents: [_commonEventId]
    CommonEvent->>GameSwitches: value(event.switchId)
    Note right of CommonEvent: active = trigger === 2 and switch is ON
    alt active
        opt !_interpreter
            CommonEvent->>CEInterpreter: <<create>> new Game_Interpreter()
        end
    else not active
        Note right of CommonEvent: _interpreter = null (a running list is dropped)
    end
    deactivate CommonEvent

    loop every frame — Game_Map.updateEvents(), after all Game_Event.update()
        GameMap->>CommonEvent: update()
        activate CommonEvent
        opt _interpreter
            CommonEvent->>CEInterpreter: isRunning()
            opt not running
                CommonEvent->>CEInterpreter: setup(list())
                Note right of CEInterpreter: restarts from the top each time it ends
            end
            CommonEvent->>CEInterpreter: update()
            Note right of CEInterpreter: runs alongside the map interpreter,<br/>see game-interpreter-update.mmd
        end
        deactivate CommonEvent
    end
